{"bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapter":{"bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十三章","chapterTitle":"第十三章","chapterSlug":"ch13","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十三章.pdf","questionCount":16,"questions":[{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch13-pdf-0001","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十三章","chapterTitle":"第十三章","number":1,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十三章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-01.webp","x":174,"y":444,"width":1046,"height":158,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":592,"width":1160,"height":113,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"發行人要將其股票在交易所掛牌買賣,交易所因提供場所,每年依據發行有價證券之總面值,向發行人收取之費用稱為","optionTexts":{"1":"掛牌費","2":"上市費","3":"場地費","4":"服務費"},"explanationText":"發行人要將其股票在交易所掛牌買賣,交易所因提供場所, 每年向發行人收取之費用稱為上市費。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"dc30745a3cd1ff3b20b773e70f0fc3adf9c8991de369696724afb37e1d16ff83","explanationSegmentsSha256":"9ea60aeed124b4048788d7394db457fb096575e5968c79d9d75fbb603ffb55e6"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch13-pdf-0002","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十三章","chapterTitle":"第十三章","number":2,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十三章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-01.webp","x":169,"y":695,"width":1051,"height":112,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":797,"width":1160,"height":67,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"股票交易之手續費是","optionTexts":{"1":"只對賣出收取","2":"只對買進收取","3":"買進、賣出均收取","4":"選項(1)(2)(3)皆非"},"explanationText":"現行制度,對股票之買進、賣出者收取手續費。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"cfdbd1cecf5a35cf32982df2d7ab3e01cccd3602ed7e83882c9ec7cf6711000b","explanationSegmentsSha256":"8dc41f1ca457d571bf0490f759f700723b8c69fc9f3782019e3cd926bd484c38"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch13-pdf-0003","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十三章","chapterTitle":"第十三章","number":3,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十三章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-01.webp","x":171,"y":854,"width":1049,"height":157,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":1001,"width":1160,"height":159,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"某投資人買進A公司股票100張,每股價格30元,手續費率為0.1425%, 則此投資人須交割之價金及各項費用合計為","optionTexts":{"1":"3,002,423元","2":"3,021,250元","3":"3,057,125 元","4":"3,004,275元"},"explanationText":"成交金額為三百萬元,手續費率為1.425%,該投資人買進股票,因買進時尚不須支付證券交易稅,故共支付=3,000,000×(1+ 0.1425%)=3,004,275元。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"29b867ab458b002a7c70d5c5d2940667932b952acb5f113bcc81c31b5ececfd5","explanationSegmentsSha256":"9b3dff14360e0b528e898bfe91e7b0cfc8f445f1b97b24826ddd287cf86e2a82"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch13-pdf-0004","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十三章","chapterTitle":"第十三章","number":4,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十三章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-01.webp","x":168,"y":1150,"width":1052,"height":159,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":1299,"width":1160,"height":159,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"臺灣證券交易所向證券商收取之經手費費率,應由其會同下列何機關擬定?","optionTexts":{"1":"證券暨期貨市場發展基金會","2":"證券櫃檯買賣中心","3":"證券商業同業公會","4":"中央銀行"},"explanationText":"依「證交所營業細則」§120第1項規定,證交所向買賣雙方證券商收取經手費,其費率由證交所會同證券商業同業公會擬訂報請主管機關核定後施行。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"c0f3a07f19eb4dfbd74af02541f83b8b74fdf3c3ea7c45e71a940561955812bc","explanationSegmentsSha256":"b7da77a8887bac991f7c4746a2c9a218c452b730559ddd57a100b854fbaa4022"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch13-pdf-0005","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十三章","chapterTitle":"第十三章","number":5,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十三章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-01.webp","x":170,"y":1448,"width":1050,"height":196,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":1634,"width":1160,"height":54,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":203,"width":1160,"height":163,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"臺灣證券交易所於每月終依據各證券商當月買賣金額計算之應收經手費金額開具帳單分送各證券商,應於次月幾日前繳清?","optionTexts":{"1":"三日","2":"五日","3":"十日","4":"十五日"},"explanationText":"依「證交所營業細則」§121規定，證交所於每月終依據各證券商當月買賣金額按前條費率計算應收經手費金額開具帳單分送各證券商，各證券商應於次月十日前繳清。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"6b7b56049a9ff620bffa9568ed76b6e99f83aa081db4ac023775a9051d0d9399","explanationSegmentsSha256":"3433f8a7c48a2a61a2211e4698f7b1e568a59950142d3c151de060ebbee325f4"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch13-pdf-0006","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十三章","chapterTitle":"第十三章","number":6,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十三章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-02.webp","x":181,"y":356,"width":1039,"height":112,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":458,"width":1160,"height":253,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"買賣臺灣存託憑證之證交稅率為","optionTexts":{"1":"0.3%","2":"0.1425%","3":"0.1%","4":"目前免徵"},"explanationText":"依「證券交易稅條例」§2規定,證券交易稅向出賣有價證券人按每次交易成交價格依下列稅率課徵之:一、公司發行之股票及表明股票權利之證書或憑證徵千分之三。二、公司債及其他經政府核准之有價證券徵千分之一。臺灣存託憑證屬於第2款之規定,所以證券交易稅率為千分之一。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"a7425c4593a19e5e4b8bad4076632caa8f89ef53955cbeb7b7ceb6a86d764ede","explanationSegmentsSha256":"51652938245c544524c43c4ca8c47e194897758816a575892cd7e5e3d8e8825e"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch13-pdf-0007","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十三章","chapterTitle":"第十三章","number":7,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十三章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-02.webp","x":181,"y":701,"width":1039,"height":113,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":804,"width":1160,"height":204,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"投資人出售槓桿型之債券指數股票型基金受益憑證,證券交易稅稅率為","optionTexts":{"1":"0.1%","2":"0.1425%","3":"0.3%","4":"停徵"},"explanationText":"依「證券交易稅條例」§2-1規定,自中華民國106年1月1 日起至115年12月31日止暫停徵證券投資信託事業募集發行以債券為主要投資標的之上市及上櫃指數股票型基金受益憑證之證券交易稅。但槓桿型及反向型之債券指數股票型基金受益憑證,不適用之。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"8cba964fe8a3ca0d337dcda07c3e730a675df2dcdb933fa26306926d42d408a2","explanationSegmentsSha256":"efe9374085ed126eae29f618219798812e4b915419ea045b0dff7f2c5d65d095"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch13-pdf-0008","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十三章","chapterTitle":"第十三章","number":8,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十三章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-02.webp","x":181,"y":998,"width":1039,"height":113,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":1101,"width":1160,"height":66,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"投資人出售非槓桿型或反向型之債券指數股票型基金受益憑證,證券交易稅稅率為","optionTexts":{"1":"0.3%","2":"0.1425%","3":"0.1%","4":"停徵"},"explanationText":"依「證券交易稅條例」§2-1規定,自中華民國106年1月1 日起至115年12月31日止暫停徵證券投資信託事業募集發行以債券為主要投資標的之上市及上櫃指數股票型基金受益憑證之證券交易稅。但槓桿型及反向型之債券指數股票型基金受益憑證,不適用之。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"1fc22f5b471348505a5cb39c39d40e8090e193b1c38d21b18a25ce9e0b0724c9","explanationSegmentsSha256":"9cc6ba4ec99c7b6b30086b630875a5f69cc63e2b9fd1856429ab68e0a0c8af4e"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch13-pdf-0009","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十三章","chapterTitle":"第十三章","number":9,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十三章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-02.webp","x":180,"y":1157,"width":1040,"height":112,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":1259,"width":1160,"height":159,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"買賣公司債及金融債券,其證券交易稅稅率為","optionTexts":{"1":"免稅","2":"0.3%","3":"0.1425%","4":"0.1%"},"explanationText":"為活絡債券市場交易,協助企業籌措資金,依「證券交易稅條例」§2-1第1項規定,自99年1月1日至115年12月31日,凡買賣公司債及金融債券,免徵證券交易稅。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"161985e06497c533a295542905d8ee7eebb504f9f16bea066ac959f2f3daf874","explanationSegmentsSha256":"d39fce0c97f3709b9ba5c20cc9e2a40c976c0f7930b4b83c289353acc59ba58b"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch13-pdf-0010","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十三章","chapterTitle":"第十三章","number":10,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十三章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-02.webp","x":175,"y":1408,"width":1045,"height":110,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":1508,"width":1160,"height":144,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"在櫃檯買賣中心買賣政府債券,其證券交易稅稅率為多少?","optionTexts":{"1":"0.1%","2":"0.1425%","3":"0.3%","4":"免稅"},"explanationText":"依「證券交易稅條例」§1規定,買賣政府公債,免課徵證券交易稅。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"e1d5dbe59f6253c769bd5f37a3fca756b42ac0bf5f7336b67f12f28688a21028","explanationSegmentsSha256":"bd9a523a162274ffbea19dcf9debc32129e85ff97a8f0b4647dbecf8210df4b3"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch13-pdf-0011","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十三章","chapterTitle":"第十三章","number":11,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十三章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-03.webp","x":156,"y":207,"width":1064,"height":113,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":310,"width":1160,"height":202,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"目前證券交易稅為","optionTexts":{"1":"買賣雙方共同負擔","2":"買方負擔","3":"賣方負擔","4":"獲利者才負擔"},"explanationText":"依「證券交易稅條例」§3規定,證券交易稅由代徵人於每次買賣交割之當日,按規定稅率代徵,並於代徵之次日,填具繳款書向國庫繳納之。代徵人代徵稅款後,應掣給規定之收據,交與證券出賣人。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"62f8bde2b1400f8d7ae3de8efb7b70271e7451d1f93cd9911f492eff53bb4b93","explanationSegmentsSha256":"4fd5dc9f52c3e6306ed2dfe817cf09ca86dcf9e6ca64fccb94d0be68f7a28495"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch13-pdf-0012","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十三章","chapterTitle":"第十三章","number":12,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十三章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-03.webp","x":153,"y":502,"width":1067,"height":160,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":652,"width":1160,"height":109,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"張三委由某證券商於交易所賣出一萬股某公司股票,成交價為每股 30元,則張三應繳證券交易稅為","optionTexts":{"1":"300元","2":"600元","3":"900元","4":"1,200元"},"explanationText":"依「證券交易稅條例」第2條第1款，股票交易稅稅率為3‰。應繳證券交易稅＝10,000股×每股30元×3‰＝900元。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"6484e8d5fbaa4c087d0aec4c6002a107eb6caa1d584dc5dc2c3842ee5c9fb6d5","explanationSegmentsSha256":"c37186b7d0875f580296b6a973baa34c9dff703085a9a320f72b1b33988e5c3e"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch13-pdf-0013","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十三章","chapterTitle":"第十三章","number":13,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十三章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-03.webp","x":152,"y":751,"width":1068,"height":112,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":853,"width":1160,"height":156,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"買賣政府債券須負擔之稅負為","optionTexts":{"1":"完全免稅","2":"證所稅","3":"利息所得稅","4":"選項(1)(2)(3)皆是"},"explanationText":"依「所得稅法」§14規定,個人之綜合所得總額,以其全年下列各類所得合併計算之(第四類)利息所得:凡公債、公司債、金融債券、各種短期票券、存款及其他貸出款項利息之所得。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"f5e3caf3197a1e3814bc964a789521d54ca12e67cf6169b7cdcc1a4cdbe6af9e","explanationSegmentsSha256":"d59e8282f8a61534355d22986a8051032e39b90a8fa7ea3d0928ac6e9a6b2923"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch13-pdf-0014","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十三章","chapterTitle":"第十三章","number":14,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十三章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-03.webp","x":152,"y":999,"width":1068,"height":157,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":1146,"width":1160,"height":59,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"有關賣出股票所需繳交之證券交易稅敘述,以下何者正確?","optionTexts":{"1":"證券交易稅為證券商收取","2":"買進時以買價計算","3":"買進與賣出時各計算一次","4":"賣出時以賣價計算"},"explanationText":"請參導讀13-5表格說明。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"5e655a9c672941c01eb09c1121ccea4e94a5eb86b12961e61222be17b347cbd0","explanationSegmentsSha256":"8cfec50b7d51e71242153f9448d4aa033ee2044c761b7ddac26bd37b62d1d6f7"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch13-pdf-0015","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十三章","chapterTitle":"第十三章","number":15,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十三章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-03.webp","x":149,"y":1195,"width":1071,"height":113,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":1298,"width":1160,"height":157,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"有關證券經紀商手續費敘述，以下何者正確？","optionTexts":{"1":"只對賣出收取","2":"收取上限為3.0‰","3":"只對買進收取","4":"可以有折扣空間"},"explanationText":"證券經紀商收取證券交易手續費，得按客戶成交金額自行訂定費率標準，另得訂定折讓及每筆委託最低費用，但上限為1.425‰；買進與賣出時各計算一次。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"8d446e01e65d47940df2e011aecb9478d7f5000c9cabfc64d2dbd333d2e6342c","explanationSegmentsSha256":"d39433bc06ee097fb01fc82c98a01163b7c0c52e8aeb6cfa64b402d920745849"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch13-pdf-0016","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十三章","chapterTitle":"第十三章","number":16,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十三章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-03.webp","x":150,"y":1445,"width":1070,"height":109,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":1544,"width":1160,"height":144,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch13/page-04.webp","x":60,"y":192,"width":1160,"height":315,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"透過櫃買中心「黃金現貨交易平臺」買賣黃金現貨交易稅的稅率為","optionTexts":{"1":"0.3%","2":"0.1425%","3":"0.1%","4":"無須繳納證券交易稅"},"explanationText":"黃金現貨非屬「證券交易法」§6第1項經主管機關核定之其他有價證券,故無須繳納證券交易稅;投資人只須支付證券經紀商手續費,手續費率則由投資人和證券商自行約定。另有關買賣黃金現貨之所得課稅部分,黃金現貨出售變現產生之利得係屬個人財產交易所得(或營利事業出售資產所得),應併入個人綜合所得(或營利事業所得)申報。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"692aa77d8938f1d0731b1e319e3f98dfe21604657d15f3330961e08093b33556","explanationSegmentsSha256":"2d251e30573baa0f72eee357215427c9f4a03416180577941caca0f509f3c815"}}]}}
